Package: tessera-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: László Zsolt Nagy <apps@nagylzs.eu>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, libegl1, libgles2
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk | xdg-desktop-portal-backend
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nagylzs/tessera-studio
Description: CSV, Excel and JSON viewer
 Tessera Studio opens CSV, Excel, OpenDocument and JSON files as pivot
 tables you can expand, filter and sort, and saves them as Excel, PDF,
 HTML and more. Free and ad-free forever: no account, no tracking, and
 your data stays on your device.
